id: pm-gh1491
title: "GH-1491: Preserve both add/add snapshots on ambiguous creation ancestry"
description: "Investigate the reported marker-free preferred-side working files after an add/add merge conflict with shared history, preserving existing creation-ancestry and immutable-history safety."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: "area:merge",data-integrity,github-intake
created_at: "2026-10-17T12:32:22.626Z"
